@startuml
' Use cases for the Eisai Studio website (React) and mobile app (Flutter).
' Both clients call the same API at https://api.eisaistudio.com/api.
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Visitor
actor Customer
actor "Admin (staff)" as Admin
actor "Mailtrap\n(email service)" as Mailtrap <<system>>
actor "Amazon S3\n(image storage)" as S3 <<system>>

Customer -|> Visitor
Admin -|> Customer

rectangle "Eisai Studio (website + mobile app)" {
  usecase "Browse menu" as UC_Menu
  usecase "Search menu\n(partial name or ingredient)" as UC_Search
  usecase "View seasonal drinks" as UC_Seasonal
  usecase "View drink details" as UC_Details
  usecase "Read our story, products,\nlocation and privacy policy" as UC_Info

  usecase "Create account" as UC_Register
  usecase "Verify email" as UC_Verify
  usecase "Resend verification email" as UC_Resend
  usecase "Log in" as UC_Login
  usecase "Reset forgotten password" as UC_Reset
  usecase "View account" as UC_Account
  usecase "Delete account" as UC_Delete

  usecase "View full menu\n(including hidden items)" as UC_AdminMenu
  usecase "Add menu item" as UC_Add
  usecase "Edit menu item" as UC_Edit
  usecase "Delete menu item" as UC_Remove
  usecase "Upload drink photo" as UC_Upload
}

Visitor --> UC_Menu
Visitor --> UC_Seasonal
Visitor --> UC_Info
Visitor --> UC_Register
Visitor --> UC_Verify
Visitor --> UC_Resend
Visitor --> UC_Login
Visitor --> UC_Reset

UC_Details .> UC_Menu : <<extend>>
UC_Search .> UC_Menu : <<extend>>

Customer --> UC_Account
Customer --> UC_Delete

Admin --> UC_AdminMenu
Admin --> UC_Add
Admin --> UC_Edit
Admin --> UC_Remove

UC_Add ..> UC_Login : <<include>>
UC_Edit ..> UC_Login : <<include>>
UC_Remove ..> UC_Login : <<include>>
UC_AdminMenu ..> UC_Login : <<include>>
UC_Delete ..> UC_Login : <<include>>
UC_Upload .> UC_Add : <<extend>>
UC_Upload .> UC_Edit : <<extend>>

UC_Register --> Mailtrap
UC_Resend --> Mailtrap
UC_Reset --> Mailtrap
UC_Upload --> S3
@enduml
